      "statusChangeID": "6a6908d5840d1d3fa18e2b33",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This has been addressed with server-side changes. \n\nThe cause was twofold:\n\n1. Some increased traffic on our end\n\n2. The usage of \"parameter compressor\" tools. \n\nParameter compressors are inherently unstable. While we understand the desire to use them and the reasons people feel they need to use them, they introduce significantly increased risk of desyncs, especially in unstable network conditions.\n\nPlease keep this caveat in mind if you choose to use these tools.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
