      "value": "VRChat is hosting an event to test this bug at the \"Capcity Stress Test Pop-up\" [sic] event tonight.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_267f579b-80d1-4e24-9892-422c84dcc94f/calendar/cal_8b0b680d-3e7e-49cc-a277-089567812939\n\n\"There will be something new being experimented with this time‚ an adjustment to make avatar parameters scale better in larger instances․ For this bring out your avatars with cursed setups‚ specifically around the usage of sync'd parameters‚ expect some to break but I'm curious how they break․\"",
